# Force the bare Netlify subdomain to the custom domain so Google sees one
# canonical host. Without this, davisk.netlify.app serves a full duplicate of
# the site (HTTP 200, no redirect) and Google indexes it as the canonical copy.
# Domain-level redirect syntax per Netlify docs (routing/redirects/redirect-options).
http://davisk.netlify.app/*  https://davisk.dev/:splat  301!
https://davisk.netlify.app/*  https://davisk.dev/:splat  301!
